# Pictures, named binary rather than left to git's NUL-byte guess, as the root
# `.gitattributes` asks of every binary in the tree. A translated byte in one of
# these is a fixture that decodes to a different picture, or none -- a test that
# fails for a reason no diff shows. Copied from gui/imagecodec/tests/data, whose
# `.txt` files beside each say what the decoder makes of it.
*.jpg  binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp  binary
*.ico  binary
*.tif  binary
